vetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">月之暗面Kimi Work升级：推出目标模式并打通主流办公应用插件</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Transformer核心作者Noam Shazeer正式加盟OpenAI，谷歌巨资挽留失败</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic为Claude筹备语音模式升级，新增多语言支持并引入通话式交互</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里联合人大开源LOGOS科学生成基础模型，实现多领域科学数据统一编码</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/1bc875d1e963cfbae78a451e577f1de8.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">6月18日，阿里ATH-Token Foundry联合中国人民大学高瓴人工智能学院正式开源多领域科学生成基础模型LOGOS。该模型通过共享词表将蛋白质、小分子及MOF材料等异构对象统一编码为离散Token序列，摆脱了对昂贵3D空间信息及几何神经网络的依赖，实现了跨学科科学数据的底层知识共享。在参数效率方面，LOGOS-1B版本仅用1/56的参数量，即在多项科学任务中超越微软NatureLM。该模型解决了预训练与下游任务的目标偏差问题，支持无需微调直接激活生成能力。目前，LOGOS已构建包含7类模态、总计44.87B tokens的预训练语料库。项目组已在HuggingFace与GitHub开源模型权重、推理代码及技术报告，旨在降低科研开发门槛，为多模态科学大模型提供统一的技术范式。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">演语科技完成近3亿美元B+轮融资，估值超20亿美元且ARR突破3亿美元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/5e735455b3801bbc6f86372d7af63e1c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">演语科技（Evoken）近日完成近3亿美元B+轮融资，投后估值超20亿美元，由Granite Asia、腾讯、顺为资本联合领投。截至2026年5月，公司ARR已突破3亿美元，5月整体收入同比增长超3000%，核心收入源自短剧、影视及广告等专业内容生产者的真实预算。演语科技已构建三条核心产品线：拥有超3000万用户及50万原创模型的AI图片创作社区LiblibAI、服务近千个团队的AI视频创作平台LibTV，以及服务超千万用户的AI设计Agent“星流”。这三款产品串联起从素材、生产到交付的完整AI内容链路。演语科技凭借超3亿美元的ARR跻身全球AI内容赛道第一梯队，其跨场景整合能力标志着AI应用正从单纯的生成质量竞争，转向工作流生产链路的深水区，为全球AI商业化落地提供了中国样本。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">月之暗面Kimi Work升级：推出目标模式并打通主流办公应用插件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8a46bf5d159bb8cf007a957ebc948bbc.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">月之暗面旗下Kimi电脑客户端近日迎来Kimi Work（Beta版）重大升级，正式推出“目标模式”并上线“插件中心”。核心功能“目标模式”基于智能循环机制，支持AI智能体在无需人工干预下连续自主工作24小时，通过对比现状与目标差距自动优化执行路径，适用于路径不确定的长任务，且运行过程对用户完全透明。同步上线的插件中心已接入百度网盘、钉钉、飞书、WPS、Canva可画及Notion等主流办公应用，用户可通过斜杠指令直接调用外部软件，实现从文本对话到操控办公软件的效率进化。官方同步推出6月限时福利，期间使用Work模式的会员额度消耗享受5折优惠。此次更新标志着Kimi Work从单一对话工具向具备自主执行能力的办公效率助手转型，显著降低了用户处理重复性办公任务的门槛。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Transformer核心作者Noam Shazeer正式加盟OpenAI，谷歌巨资挽留失败</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/40228632a3893ece841b3cb4f05c2fbb.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Transformer架构核心作者、AI领域顶尖研究员Noam Shazeer近日正式宣布加入OpenAI。Shazeer曾是谷歌Gemini项目的技术负责人，此次离职标志着他时隔不到两年再次离开谷歌。此前，谷歌曾于2024年斥资约27亿美元通过技术许可协议将其召回，试图巩固其在AI研发领域的人才优势。作为《Attention Is All You Need》论文的主要作者，Shazeer被誉为现代大模型核心技术的奠基人之一。随着他的离去，Transformer论文的八位原作者已全部离开谷歌，其中两人现已入职OpenAI。此次人事变动不仅为OpenAI注入了关键研发动力，也进一步加剧了科技巨头间对顶级AI人才的争夺。Shazeer此前曾因谷歌拒绝发布其开发的聊天机器人而离职，并创办了Character.AI，其</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic为Claude筹备语音模式升级，新增多语言支持并引入通话式交互</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/080fe9189b1afd9bb85fd10d4f20ed83.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic正在为其AI助手Claude筹备语音模式的重大升级，核心在于打破语言壁垒并优化交互逻辑。根据iOS版Claude应用设置界面显示，此次更新将新增中文、粤语、日语、德语、西班牙语、葡萄牙语、俄语及乌克兰语支持，彻底改变此前仅支持英语的现状。在交互模式上，Claude新增了“按下通话”模式，用户需长按按钮进行语音输入，并保留了原有的“免提”连续对话模式。此外，应用界面中出现的电话听筒图标暗示，Anthropic正致力于打造更接近传统语音通话的即时交互体验。此次布局旨在提升Claude在多语言环境下的可用性，使AI对话更自然、更具自主权，进一步强化了Claude作为多语言AI助手的竞争优势。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
